{"id":"n2-029","title":"Noun を はじめ (Noun wo hajime)","jlptLevel":2,"shortExplanation":"Meaning 'starting with', 'including', 'not only... but also'.","longExplanation":"The grammar point Nounをはじめ is used to show that there are other things or people being included apart from the mentioned noun. It can be used to provide an example, indicate a representative or list items. This can be translated as 'starting with', 'including', or 'not only... but also...' in English.","formation":"Noun + をはじめ","examples":[{"jp":"日本料理をはじめ、さまざまな料理がこのレストランで楽しめます。","romaji":"Nihon ryouri wo hajime, samazama na ryouri ga kono resutoran de tanoshimemasu.","en":"You can enjoy various dishes in this restaurant, starting with Japanese cuisine.","words":[{"surface":"日本","vocabId":"1582710","reading":"にほん"},{"surface":"料理","vocabId":"1554310","reading":"りょうり"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"はじめ","vocabId":"1342540","reading":"はじめ"},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"さまざま","vocabId":"1593830","reading":"さまざま"},{"surface":"な","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"だ"},{"surface":"料理","vocabId":"1554310","reading":"りょうり"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"レストラン","vocabId":null},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null},{"surface":"楽しめ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"楽しめる"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[2,3]},{"jp":"彼は絵画をはじめ、彫刻や写真もコレクションしている。","romaji":"Kare wa kaiga wo hajime, choukoku ya shashin mo korekushon shite iru.","en":"He collects not only paintings but also sculptures and photographs.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"絵画","vocabId":"1202300","reading":"かいが"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"はじめ","vocabId":"1342540","reading":"はじめ"},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"彫刻","vocabId":"1427980","reading":"ちょうこく"},{"surface":"や","vocabId":null},{"surface":"写真","vocabId":"1321900","reading":"しゃしん"},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"コレクション","vocabId":null},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いる","vocabId":"1577980","reading":"いる"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3,4]},{"jp":"京都をはじめ、日本のいくつかの都市で伝統的な祭りが行われている。","romaji":"Kyouto wo hajime, Nihon no ikutsu ka no toshi de dentouteki na matsuri ga okonawarete iru.","en":"Traditional festivals are held in several cities in Japan, including Kyoto.","words":[{"surface":"京都","vocabId":"1652350","reading":"きょうと"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"はじめ","vocabId":"1342540","reading":"はじめ"},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"日本","vocabId":"1582710","reading":"にほん"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いくつ","vocabId":"1219960","reading":"いくつ"},{"surface":"か","vocabId":null},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"都市","vocabId":"1444990","reading":"とし"},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null},{"surface":"伝統","vocabId":"1442260","reading":"でんとう"},{"surface":"的","vocabId":"1437260","reading":"てき"},{"surface":"な","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"だ"},{"surface":"祭り","vocabId":"1604130","reading":"まつり"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"行わ","vocabId":"1589060","reading":"おこなう","baseForm":"行う"},{"surface":"れ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"れる"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いる","vocabId":"1577980","reading":"いる"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[1,2]},{"jp":"太陽をはじめ、地球や火星などの惑星も太陽系に含まれている。","romaji":"Taiyou wo hajime, chikyuu ya kasei nado no wakusei mo taiyoukei ni fukumarete iru.","en":"Not only the Sun, but also planets such as Earth and Mars are included in the solar system.","words":[{"surface":"太陽","vocabId":"1408370","reading":"たいよう"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"はじめ","vocabId":"1342540","reading":"はじめ"},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"地球","vocabId":"1420970","reading":"ちきゅう"},{"surface":"や","vocabId":null},{"surface":"火星","vocabId":"1194060","reading":"かせい"},{"surface":"な